<title>USA: Arthur Gallagher unit forms joint venture.</title>
<headline>Arthur Gallagher unit forms joint venture.</headline>
<dateline>ITASCA, Ill. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arthur J. Gallagher &amp; Co said Thursday its Gallagher Bassett Services unit has formed a joint venture with Wyatt Group in Australia.</p>
<p>Gallagher said the venture, called Wyatt Gallagher Bassett, will provide adjusting, marine and aviation surveying, claims management and risk control consulting services in the Australian market.</p>
<p>Gallagher is an insurance brokerage and risk management services.</p>
<p>Its shares closed off 1/8 Thursday at 32-1/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
